<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia is hosting regional talks in Egypt with leaders of Eritrea, Sudan and its own officials while keeping a neutral stance as Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions rise. The federal government is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and is pursuing defence cooperation with Pakistan, including acquiring JF‑17 fighter jets, while also securing the release of four Pakistani sailors from Somali pirates. Somali forces killed two al-Shabaab militants in the Bay region and a military court chief linked a father’s killing to the 2017 Mogadishu bombing case. The lower house passed a long-delayed anti-rape bill and a market shooting in Garowe left two dead and four wounded. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOcXdJeDgzMFBMd05vTXFZWEpIZk1jcEZucTRHbTNfemZrdTBvSkFmMG1leGN0Y3FsTE1NWFF4ZHZpZ2FzTHpUaDh4ajBBN2RWYXlyYzM5RDVUODJjUHlwNFNsdnMtTnVHTDNRM0xYX3ExY0k1YkNfY0pZVHktYmt5eU5OVF82eW0xWmtqT2ZHVkV4Vm9FNndqVGF2Nm1mS3V0UjE2MFpjbHFwRTN3NENSenJidGRQTW5p?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPSnJVLTRnNHp5RHVKaEU1QUFZajQya2p5Vjc4SFJoWVhpNXJnaEdlOFQ1UXhVM1JwS0VsdWRrUmdpYXF6NWFmNm5hZVllY1BQN3cwMXpfUDUyOGRPeDhTVm9Qa0pNaUhHNmtUa21IdEpkOVZNR2RHaVJXNTNkSUJyTmdXM2lSTkVpS1NQQmJKTHZRVDFRYnVGdGxEWEw4RC02Z1Y2TGZURUhqeTc5Qm9sakIyVlROcFJvVm5yQkFWWS00TF8yWGRGTWNZOUI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQbGZvdnJtM0xycXFRQmRXdXFhZ3N0N2VzWnVYYThrWHk1VzhqMlkxSW95cmkwWjVNMGRFQ0dzeTBrQmtDVzNxdmxzcGlKM3FpcTBhM1NCYVQ0cFpxNUszS2dLa